- **Cabinet↔Связки (hard):** mutate → reload/verify `adsList` → update sheet **same turn**. Map: status→`статус`, CPM→**`cpm`**, budget→`budget`, daily→`daily_budget`; note in `заметка`. Checklist: `общее/tgads-кабинет.md`.
- **Admin gate:** paste `tga_…` into Marketing Panel before Create Ad. `@surfvpn` = `@getSurfVpnBot` (aliases). Export: `python общее/scripts/export_tgads_admin_campaigns.py`.
- **No duplicate Ad title / `start_param`** in cabinet or Связки.
- Destination aliases OK. Title = `tga_{pl}_{cr}_{tx}_{scope}_{slug}_{cab}` (`eur`/`ton`). `?start` same except Search (no tag — don't analyze Search funnel).
- **Per-channel / per-bot testing (current phase):** Channels and Bots ads only with `scope=s` (one `@login` per ad). Do **not** buy via multi-member `c01`/`b01` lists — one click-fraud or fake-MAU bot would poison the whole list and you cannot see which member is dirty from the `tga_` tag. Search `q01` is the exception (queries). Details: `общее/tgads-нейминг.md`.
- Default test: **€5 / €5**, views 1, On Hold. Start CPM: channel €1.50, lists/bots/search €2, Users €2.50.
- **Funnel priority:** purchases first, else trials (live). Cheap CPC alone is not a win (30 trials @ €0.70 CPC beats 3 trials @ €0.30). Velvet-type low trial/start → don't scale budget.
- **CPM bump only for underdelivery** (win auctions / get views), not “quality”. Age in **Europe/Berlin**. Grid: 0–10 views &lt;1d wait; 0–10 & ≥1d → +€1 (cap path ~€7–9) else Hold if already €8–9+; 11–49 & ≥1d → +€0.50 or Hold; 50–99 → +€0.50; 100+ → +€0.25. Manual review 2–3×/day. Stopped `daily < daily_spent` on a good ad → raise daily/budget and reactivate.
- **Bots:** check MAU before Create, but high MAU + ~0 views ≥1d → status `накрученный бот`. YouTube in ad text = blacklist. Evergreen own-bot KPI TBD.
- Texts t01/t04: paired by slug, purchases→trials; no global kill on soft gaps. Details in `общее/tgads-кабинет.md`.
